## Slide numbers

- Currently there are {{ git_count_files(pattern="odp/**/*.odp") }} odp files in this repo.
- Currently there are {{ git_count_files(pattern="marp/**/*.md") }} marp files in this repo.
- Currently there are {{ shell_output(command="grep -R -- '^---$' marp | wc -l") }} marp slides in this repo.
- Currently there are {{ shell_output(command="grep -r '<svg' marp/ --include='*.md' | wc -l") }} SVG diagrams in this repo.
- Currently there are {{ shell_output(command="grep -rP '^\\|.*---.*\\|' marp/ --include='*.md' | wc -l") }} tables in this repo.
- Currently there are {{ shell_output(command="grep -r 'class=.mermaid.' marp/ --include='*.md' | wc -l") }} mermaid diagrams in this repo.
